# NOTE: This package ships its TypeScript/JSX sources on purpose.
# package.json has "postinstall": "npm run build", and the installer
# (installer.js -> nodeMcps) copies this folder and runs `npm install`
# followed by `npm run build` in it. Both need src/ and tsconfig.json,
# and build/ is git-ignored (never checked in). Excluding the sources
# here makes the published tarball unbuildable and postinstall fails
# deterministically. Do not re-add /src or tsconfig.json.

# Development tools
.cursor/
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Test files
manual_animation_test.jsx

# Logs and temp files
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
/temp
*.temp.*
**/temp/
